      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW RAELIA (1) flew the lids with a fast early split last time, hitting the frame with a 8 length third (27.64) over 485m at Horsham and making it two placings on end. Has a win and two minor placings from three starts from this draw. One of the contenders. MINER MICK (3) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish 2 lengths away in second (29.80) behind Sir Silvertree at Sandown. The form out of last race has been strong. Expected to feature again. PAW MONET (8) drawn the outside box and could get a clear run. Was below best last time when 8th and beaten 17 lengths at Sandown (30.53). Goes very well at course and distance boasting two wins. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Has ability and is one of the better chances. ILLUMINATOR (7) cannot be left out after placing in impressive time last start.",
